      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im having the worst headache of my life rn. it literally just hit me out of nowhere like a clap of thunder or something. i feel kinda nauseous too but ive had bad migraines before so i figured it might just be a really bad one. should i just take my sumatriptan and try to sleep it off?",
