      "content": "wait r u sure? i mean i've had migraines that felt pretty intense before and they went away after i took my meds. this just feels like a really intense version of my usual ones. if i just take the sumatriptan now and wait an hour, would that be okay? i really don't want to go to the er if i don't have to, it's so expensive and i'm pretty sure it's just a migraine.",
